<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Four Seasons raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Four Seasons raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Wednesday it added Four Seasons Hotels Inc to the recommended list, having previously rated the shares a market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/16 to 33-1/2 in New York.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
